From: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Register the YANG management owner source commit

Qualify only the source-owned module version with its exact source commit.
Build definitions, dependency pins, runtime coverage and the config-engine lock reference
are owned by that source; no registry BUILD or requirements overlay is applied.

Source commit: e80dd36fcf1e128734bfe81b3f4c9ce13bd1640b
Scope: downstream registry integration; not an upstream bug fix.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 module(
     name = "sonic-yang-mgmt",
-    version = "1.0.1",
+    version = "1.0.1-e80dd36fcf1e128734bfe81b3f4c9ce13bd1640b",
 )
 
 bazel_dep(name = "libyang-python", version = "3.1.0.sonic.6", repo_name = "libyang_python")
